# Live: explore browser → Agents tab

Output out/06-explore-agents-tab.mp4
Output out/06-explore-agents-tab.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 2560
Set Height 1600
Set Padding 10
Set Margin 0
Set TypingSpeed 25ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 24
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Hide
Type "./bin/run-spur-tui-live.sh"
Enter
Show
Wait+Screen@25s /Lineage/
Sleep 800ms
Hide
Ctrl+K
Show
Wait+Screen@15s /Go to/
Hide
Type "Explore"
Enter
Show
Wait+Screen@20s /synced/
Sleep 800ms
Hide
Tab
Show
Sleep 2s
